{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1809a7f69b66b7fe","name":"San-Ni Staff","source":{"id":"source:reference-1809a7f69b66b7fe","title":"San-Ni Staff","revision":20511,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:59:47Z","sha256":"95eb595a42c8cc695d2872046858ee2873fdc38216e4a26158acfd71f0fe77d3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20511","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=San-Ni%20Staff&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1809a7f69b66b7fe","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The San-Ni Staff is favored by martial artists throughout the galaxy, including Jedi weapon masters looking for more variety than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"}," offer. Consisting of three metal rods held together by power couplings, the San-Ni Staff is a flexible weapon that can be whipped around the wielder's body in combat, both for leverage and to confuse an opponent. Moreover, a San-Ni Staff's power couplings are made of pure energy that are impervious to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," damage (much as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," blades are).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A San-Ni Staff is a Double Weapon. You can attack with both ends of the weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty (although certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," can reduce these penalties).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, the San-Ni Staff can be used in conjunction with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," Talent as though it were a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". Also, the wielder of a San-Ni Staff can designate (at the time the attack is made) that he or she is striking the opponent with the power couplings, dealing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage instead of normal, lethal damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A San-Ni Staff requires two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cells"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cells"}," to operate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 4,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6/2d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2.2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy and Bludgeoning\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
